### Contact form
# Formspree endpoint the contact form POSTs to (https://formspree.io/f/<form-id>).
# The site is statically built, so this value is baked into the HTML at build
# time and is therefore public by design. Also passed to the Docker build in CI.
FORMSPREE_URL="https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id"
